---
import ArrowUpRight from './ArrowUpRight.astro';
const pressEmail = 'mailto:ulp@ugr.es?subject=Prensa%20%7C%20UGR%20LAN%20Party';
---

<section class="press-section design-container" aria-labelledby="press-title">
  <div class="press-heading">
    <div>
      <span class="design-eyebrow">Para contar lo que pasa aquí</span>
      <h2 id="press-title">La ULP,<br /><em>también es noticia</em></h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      ¿Preparas una noticia o una entrevista? Escríbenos y te ayudamos con la
      información y el material de la ULP.
    </p>
  </div>
  <article class="press-card" data-spotlight>
    <div class="press-copy">
      <div class="press-meta">
        <span>Nota de prensa · Archivo 2026</span>
        <time datetime="2026-03-08">08 / 03 / 2026</time>
      </div>
      <h3>Videojuegos y comunidad universitaria en Granada</h3>
      <p>
        La nota de presentación de la 8.ª edición de UGR LAN Party, celebrada
        los días 20 y 21 de marzo de 2026 en la ETSIIT.
      </p>
      <ul class="press-highlights">
        <li>
          <span aria-hidden="true">01</span>Torneos, charlas, retos y juego
          libre.
        </li>
        <li>
          <span aria-hidden="true">02</span>Estudiantes, profesorado, empresas y
          aficionados.
        </li>
        <li>
          <span aria-hidden="true">03</span>Entrada gratuita e inscripción
          previa en torneos.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div class="press-actions">
        <a class="design-button" href={pressEmail}
          >Contactar con prensa <span aria-hidden="true"><ArrowUpRight /></span
          ></a
        >
        <a
          class="press-open"
          href="https://linktr.ee/ulpugr"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >Redes de la ULP <span aria-hidden="true"><ArrowUpRight /></span></a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="press-preview" aria-label="Datos de la edición 2026">
      <span class="press-preview-label">UGR LAN PARTY / 8.ª EDICIÓN</span>
      <div class="press-poster">
        <span class="press-poster-kicker">Granada · 2026</span>
        <strong>20<span aria-hidden="true">—</span>21</strong>
        <span class="press-month">de marzo</span>
        <span class="press-poster-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p>Dos días.<br /><em>Muchas partidas</em></p>
        <span class="press-poster-location"
          >ETSIIT<br />Universidad de Granada</span
        >
      </div>
      <span class="press-preview-label">ARCHIVO / EDICIÓN FINALIZADA</span>
    </aside>
  </article>
  <div class="press-contact">
    <span>Para entrevistas, imágenes y consultas de medios</span>
    <a href="mailto:ulp@ugr.es?subject=Prensa%20%7C%20UGR%20LAN%20Party"
      >ulp@ugr.es <span aria-hidden="true"><ArrowUpRight /></span></a
    >
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .press-section {
    padding-block: 24px clamp(56px, 7vw, 100px);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .press-heading {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 34px;
  }
  .press-heading .design-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 60px);
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }
  em {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .press-heading > p {
    max-width: 35ch;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .press-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(260px, 0.85fr);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .press-copy {
    padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 48px);
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .press-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 14px;
    font:
      9px/1.6 ui-monospace,
      monospace;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: clamp(25px, 3vw, 38px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    text-wrap: balance;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .press-copy > p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 58ch;
  }
  .press-highlights {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-block: 26px;
    margin-block: 22px 28px;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .press-highlights li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .press-highlights li > span {
    font:
      9px ui-monospace,
      monospace;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .press-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .press-actions .design-button {
    gap: 18px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .press-open {
    font-size: 12px;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 5px;
  }
  .press-open span {
    margin-left: 8px;
  }
  .press-file {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 18px;
    font:
      9px/1.7 ui-monospace,
      monospace;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .press-preview {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 30px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        350px circle at var(--pointer-x, 100%) var(--pointer-y, 40%),
        rgb(0 100 113 / 0.65),
        transparent 85%
      ),
      #063349;
    color: #f5f0e6;
  }
  .press-preview-label {
    font:
      9px ui-monospace,
      monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    opacity: 0.65;
  }
  .press-poster {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    padding-block: 30px;
  }
  .press-poster-kicker {
    font:
      10px ui-monospace,
      monospace;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    opacity: 0.65;
  }
  .press-poster > strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: clamp(55px, 6vw, 84px);
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.07em;
    margin-top: 24px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .press-poster > strong > span {
    font-weight: 300;
    opacity: 0.35;
    margin-inline: 4px;
  }
  .press-month {
    font:
      italic 34px Georgia,
      serif;
  }
  .press-poster-rule {
    display: block;
    width: 40px;
    height: 1px;
    background: currentColor;
    opacity: 0.4;
    margin-block: 30px;
  }
  .press-poster p {
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .press-poster-location {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 26px;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .press-contact {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 15px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .press-contact > span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .press-contact a {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--ink);
    outline-offset: 5px;
  }
  .press-preview:focus-visible {
    outline-color: #f5f0e6;
    outline-offset: -5px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .press-heading {
      align-items: start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 22px;
    }
    .press-heading > p {
      max-width: 55ch;
    }
    .press-card {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(220px, 0.7fr);
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .press-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .press-preview {
      padding: 30px;
    }
    .press-poster {
      padding-block: 10px;
    }
    .press-meta {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
